@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p class="lead">
    Our web site intends to help Canadians for easier and enjoyable life.
</p>

<p>
    CanHappy is a community-focused platform where people across Canada can discover opportunities,
    connect with each other, and share useful local information.
</p>

<h2>What We Offer</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Simple browsing and posting for everyday needs.</li>
    <li>Multiple practical categories, including Buy &amp; Sell, Car &amp; Vehicle, Home Rental, Estate Sale, Car Pool,
        and Business Yellow Page.</li>
        <li>A user-friendly way to communicate and collaborate within local communities.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Goal</h2>
    <p>
        We aim to build a trustworthy online place that supports daily life in Canada by making information and connections
        easier to access.
    </p>